<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were weak to $0.50 Lower. Demand was moderate to light on a moderate movement. Top $54.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  52.00-53.50 Few 51.50-54.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  46.00-51.50</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  41.00-46.00</p>
<p>Sows - off $1.00-2.00. Top $51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 41.00-44.00 Few 40.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 44.00-47.00</p>
<p>		500-650 lbs. 48.00-51.00</p>
</text>
